    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1548">

                <pb facs="0992" n="876" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg876"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.51/73.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Agent Canova.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-29T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 29, 1914—4 p.m</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department desires you proceed Zacatecas in accordance with its July 22, 3 p.m.
                    You will avail yourself of every opportunity to <pb facs="0993" n="877"
                        xml:id="pg877"/> secure information as to opinion of Constitutionalist
                    leaders regarding the effect the decree of July 14th of General Villareal
                    against the church has produced.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. J. Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
